颗镶嵌在中亚腹地的明珠……\",\n        history: \"粟特人曾在绿洲建城……\",\n        building: \"在这片被沙漠与绿洲亲吻的土地上……\",\n        clothing: \"在乌兹别克斯坦，服饰不仅是遮体御寒之物……\",\n        religion: \"在这片被沙漠与绿洲分割的土地上，宗教如同锡尔河的水流……\",\n      };\n      this.bottomText = bottomMap[b.class];\n    },\n    goUzbekistan() {\n      this.$router.push({ name: \"Uzbekistan\" });\n    },\n  },\n  mounted() {\n    import('../legacy/uzbekistan.dom.js');\n  }\n};\n</script>\n\n<style scoped>\n@import \"../assets/index.css\";\n.user-popup {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 100px;\n  right: 120px;\n  width: 180px;\n  background: #fff;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n  padding: 12px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  z-index: 100;\n}\n.map-dot {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 14px;\n  height: 14px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  box-shadow: 0px 0px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n.map-dot:hover { transform: scale(1.4); }\n.tooltip {\n  position: absolute;\n  background: #fff;\n  color: #000;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  padding: 8px 10px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  max-width: 200px;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n.tooltip--right {\n  transform: translate(20px, -10px);\n}\n</style>"],"mappings":";;;;AAsFA,eAAe;EACbA,IAAI,EAAE,YAAY;EAClBC,IAAI,WAAJA,IAAIA,CAAA,EAAG;IACL,OAAO;MACLC,UAAU,EAAE,IAAI;MAChBC,gBAAgB,EAAE,KAAK;MACvBC,cAAc,EAAE,KAAK;MACrBC,UAAU,EAAE,WAAW;MACvBC,WAAW,EAAE,EAAE;MACfC,UAAU,EAAE,uBAAuB;MACnCC,UAAU,EAAE,CACV;QAAEC,KAAK,EAAE,MAAM;QAAEC,GAAG,EAAE;MAAO,CAAC,EAC9B;QAAED,KAAK,EAAE,MAAM;QAAEC,GAAG,EAAE;MAAQ,CAAC,EAC/B;QAAED,KAAK,EAAE,MAAM;QAAEC,GAAG,EAAE;MAAQ,CAAC,EAC/B;QAAED,KAAK,EAAE,MAAM;QAAEC,GAAG,EAAE;MAAQ,CAAC,CAChC;MACDC,IAAI,EAAE,CACJ;QAAED,GAAG,EAAE,OAAO;QAAEE,IAAI,EAAE,OAAO;QAAEC,IAAI,EAAE,cAAc;QAAEC,KAAK,EAAE;MAAU,CAAC,EACvE;QAAEJ,GAAG,EAAE,OAAO;QAAEE,IAAI,EAAE,OAAO;QAAEC,IAAI,EAAE,QAAQ;QAAEC,KAAK,EAAE;MAAU,CAAC,EACjE;QAAEJ,GAAG,EAAE,OAAO;QAAEE,IAAI,EAAE,OAAO;QAAEC,IAAI,EAAE,IAAI;QAAEC,KAAK,EAAE;MAAU,CAAC,EAC7D;QAAEJ,GAAG,EAAE,